# UsaBanner module manifest. PowerShellVersion is 5.1 on purpose: Windows
# PowerShell must be able to import the module, so that each command can
# hand itself to pwsh (UsaBanner.psm1 says how). FileList is every file of
# the module, in ordinal order: a deploy copies those alone, and the Group
# Policy publish and the build refuse a folder that holds more or fewer
# (docs/DECISIONS.md, D32). tests\Loader.Tests.ps1 holds it to the folder.
